errors.Join over a slice built with append in a loop.
Under Go semantics every rule origin is reachable behind "%s: %w" + errors.Join. Slice elements are documented as
out of scope (memory), so expect either those origins or an explicit unresolved(memory) entry - never 0 entries.
-- args --
rules/rules.go:@all
